{{smaller block|From this tyme forth, tyme is to holde my peas;
Hit werieth me this matier for to ''trete''.
{{right|''Political Poems'', etc. (ed. Furnivall), p. 54.}}}}

3†. To address; discourse to.

{{smaller block|Then Teutra tho triet men ''tretid'' o this wise:
